  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If Japanese IME isn't set before VRChat has finished loading, the IME doesn't work once in-game. Switching language input to Japanese IME after VRChat has launched doesn't work, requiring a full restart of the game.\n\nThis bug creates a hassle for multi-lingual speakers that use the chat box. It also creates confusion and misunderstandings as many assume that Japanese isn't supported when it doesn't work switching after launch.\n\nHeard from a friend that if Japanese is set and they switch to Chinese, Chinese then also doesn't work, but I haven't tested this. VRChat should ideally support switching language input method at any time.",
